      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 199.19999999999996,
        "t": 557.34591953125,
        "r": 332.21999999999997,
        "b": 523.5722344167463
      },
      "content": "2. Gently pull the metal clip out of each corner and lift off the door seal."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0222",
      "reading_order": 1351,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 194.2672807843808,
