        "l": 50.4,
        "t": 157.50601953125,
        "r": 293.094,
        "b": 149.31873047605825
      },
      "content": "Switch the oven on and let it heat up to 250°C (482°F)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1081",
      "reading_order": 1357,
      "section": "Heating up the oven to dry the seal",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.39100000000002,
        "t": 144.66301953125003,
        "r": 212.445,
        "b": 136.4757304760583
      },
      "content": "Keep the door shut for two hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1082",
      "reading_order": 1358,
      "section": "Heating up the oven to dry the seal",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 35.98199999999997,
        "t": 129.18301953125,
        "r": 254.43899999999996,
        "b": 121.09533441674625
      },
      "content": "The oven will be ready for usage again after 2 hours"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1083",
      "reading_order": 1359,
      "section": "Heating up the oven to dry the seal",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 26.039999999999992,
        "t": 112.74591953125002,
        "r": 275.09430000000003,
        "b": 91.94123441674617
      },
      "content": "Note: This is a generic procedure for  the complete range of Merrychef combination ovens."
