      "id": "txt_1088",
      "reading_order": 1368,
      "section": "WARNING",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 362.28,
        "t": 411.42601953125,
        "r": 536.0970000000001,
        "b": 365.18733441674624
      },
      "content": "6. Press down firmly to tightly secure the door seal onto the door. Ensure it is level and square. Wipe off any excess sealant protruding for the door seal."
